OL,3,AHealey pledges cheaper marmalade and
OL,4,Agherkins in pre-Budget package of
OL,5,A'everyday fixes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Conservatives said the offer of
OL,8,F"cheaper gherkins" was "an insult to
OL,9,Ffamilies hammered by Labour's tax
OL,10,Frises".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
